type: software
title: "Exegete"
abstract: "Exegete (formerly qualcoder-mcp): a qualitative data analysis application used in conversation with an AI assistant and compatible with QualCoder. It creates, reads, analyses and, with researcher approval, writes to QualCoder projects. Technically, a Model Context Protocol server."
